                                "sense_id": "ce397fef-f402-3974-8595-894a7f5ec4e2",
                                "text": "During the Pleistocene, megafauna were diverse across the globe, with most continental ecosystems exhibiting similar or greater species richness in megafauna as compared to ecosystems in Africa today.",
